      "updated": 1786303777724,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Cat 6A taken at 0.30 in OD, 12-strand distribution fiber at 0.20 in OD. Check the actual OD on the datasheet -\nshielded Cat 6A runs 0.35 in and up, which costs you roughly a third of the count.",
      "originalText": "Cat 6A taken at 0.30 in OD, 12-strand distribution fiber at 0.20 in OD. Check the actual OD on the datasheet - shielded Cat 6A runs 0.35 in and up, which costs you roughly a third of the count.",
